Eh, there's one more here too.

1689
01:24:24,014 --> 01:24:24,814
いいよ。
Go ahead.

1690
01:24:24,914 --> 01:24:25,914
え、いいの？
Eh, really?

1691
01:24:26,014 --> 01:24:26,914
のじゃ。
Yup.

1692
01:24:27,914 --> 01:24:29,414
え、ありがとう！
Eh, thank you!

1693
01:24:29,514 --> 01:24:30,614
おー！
Ooh!

1694
01:24:32,714 --> 01:24:33,914
強くなった？
Did I get stronger?

1695
01:24:34,014 --> 01:24:35,914
強くなった気がする。
I feel like I got stronger.

1696
01:24:36,014 --> 01:24:36,914
よかった。
Great.

1697
01:24:37,014 --> 01:24:37,914
おー！
Ooh!

1698
