The helicopter is carrying it right now.

1718
01:25:20,869 --> 01:25:22,189
効果なんじゃない？
Isn't that how it works?

1719
01:25:24,509 --> 01:25:25,629
入れ手！入れ手！
Put it in! Put it in!

1720
01:25:25,629 --> 01:25:26,869
入れ手！入れ手！
Put it in! Put it in!

1721
01:25:26,869 --> 01:25:28,349
入れ手！入れ手！
Put it in! Put it in!

1722
01:25:28,349 --> 01:25:30,029
