Ah, it went all the way over there!

1730
01:25:45,309 --> 01:25:47,389
最強！
Strongest!

1731
01:25:47,669 --> 01:25:49,189
映画すごい抜けるな...
The sound travels so well...

1732
01:25:50,789 --> 01:25:52,229
なんかみんな強気って感じ
Feels like everyone is feeling confident.

1733
