Ah, huh? Huh? Ah, amazing!

1769
01:27:23,869 --> 01:27:24,829
のじゃ
Noja.

1770
01:27:25,069 --> 01:27:26,549
へんてこな石
A weird stone.

1771
01:27:26,629 --> 01:27:27,629
行けた行けた
We made it, we made it.

1772
01:27:27,749 --> 01:27:28,989
美術館っぽい
Looks like a museum.

1773
01:27:29,989 --> 01:27:32,589
