The elephant-like one.

1780
01:27:43,029 --> 01:27:44,269
あ、やべぇやつだ！
Ah, that dangerous one!

1781
01:27:44,389 --> 01:27:45,669
あ、クソやべぇやつ！
Ah, that super dangerous one!

1782
01:27:45,869 --> 01:27:46,989
じゃ、こっち行かない方がいい？
Then should we not go this way?

1783
01:27:48,109 --> 01:27:50,109
ジュエルある。後で取りたい
There's a jewel. I wanna pick it up later.

1784
01:27:50,749 --> 01:27:51,989
キョーコに取ってもらおう、あれ
Let me get Kyoko to pick that up.

1785
01:27:52,309 --> 01:27:53,189
かわいい！
Cute!

1786
