そっちにヤバい敵がいるから、一旦なし！一旦なし！
There's a dangerous enemy there, so cancel that for now! Cancel it!

1794
01:28:10,629 --> 01:28:11,549
でも持ってきちゃった
But I already brought it.

1795
01:28:11,629 --> 01:28:12,829
じゃあ乗っけて待っている
Then put it on and wait.

1796
01:28:13,389 --> 01:28:15,509
あ、やばい！来てる！来てるぞ！
Ah, oh no! It's coming! It's coming!

1797
01:28:15,829 --> 01:28:17,149
別の部屋に逃げればいい？
Should we run to another room?

1798
01:28:19,829 --> 01:28:20,829
のじゃ
Noja.

1799
01:28:21,629 --> 01:28:22,669
のじゃ
Noja.

1800
01:28:23,029 --> 01:28:25,629
あと探索してないの、そっちだけか。こっち見たよね？
Is that the only unexplored area left over there? We checked here, right?

1801
01:28:26,549 --> 01:28:27,469
ここ見たね
We checked here.

1802
01:28:28,029 --> 01:28:28,949
こっち見たか
We checked this side, huh.

1803
01:28:30,949 --> 01:28:32,829
敵が来たから諦めたところじゃん
That's where we gave up because an enemy came.

1804
01:28:33,589 --> 01:28:34,749
でも全部見た
But we checked everything.

1805
01:28:36,109 --> 01:28:38,109
じゃ、もう敵がいるところだけか
Then all that's left are the areas with enemies, huh.

1806
01:28:38,109 --> 01:28:39,229
どうしたんですか？
What's wrong?

1807
01:28:39,229 --> 01:28:41,909
大丈夫？どうしたんですか、探索組さん？何したの？
Are you okay? What happened, exploration team? What did you do?

1808
01:28:42,869 --> 01:28:43,989
なになに？
What is it, what is it?

1809
01:28:43,989 --> 01:28:45,309
いや、俺だけ...
No, just me...

1810
01:28:46,989 --> 01:28:47,789
いる
It's here.

1811
01:28:58,189 --> 01:28:59,029
来る...
It's coming...

1812
01:29:00,709 --> 01:29:01,549
来ないで...
Don't come...

1813
01:29:02,429 --> 01:29:04,949
こっち来られたら、もうどこにも行けない
If it comes this way, I won't be able to go anywhere.

1814
01:29:10,269 --> 01:29:12,269
確かに一旦納品したっていいよな
True, we could just deposit our loot for now.

1815
01:29:13,989 --> 01:29:16,469
