Movement speed... Ah, and there's that! Health! The one that raises your max health!

2154
01:45:31,661 --> 01:45:33,161
めっちゃいいじゃん！
That's super good!

2155
01:45:36,161 --> 01:45:39,861
スプリントスピード強化してくか。あ、リロールもある。
Should we upgrade sprint speed? Oh, there's a reroll too.

2156
