Yeah, probably the reach distance... or the hit box becomes wider.

2161
01:45:53,161 --> 01:45:54,861
なかなか強いね、それもね。
That's pretty strong too.

2162
01:45:54,861 --> 01:45:55,661
のじゃー！
Yeah!

2163
